/home/yixunhu/codespace/xRIR_code/worklog/worklog_yixun/exp_06_oriented_cyl_claude/plan_oriented_cyl.md-116-
/home/yixunhu/codespace/xRIR_code/worklog/worklog_yixun/exp_06_oriented_cyl_claude/plan_oriented_cyl.md-117-**Overall reading.** The positive conclusion is scoped to the **hallway C50 deficit**: "the orientation-conditioned cylindrical pipeline removes the hallway C50 deficit" iff G1 passes and both H1 and H1b hold (neither void, both converged). H2 describes every other cell (detected harm / improvement / no detected difference); H3 states whether the pipeline costs simulated accuracy. C − F is conditional on unpaired pretraining realisations (C is a new training run) and is labelled so. Anything else is reported as found; margins and rules change only through §10a amendments logged before the affected runs.
